# Scanners

- Class implementing `Scanner` (`name`, `appliesTo`, `scan`).
- Wire in `src/engine/built-ins.ts`. Export from `src/scanners/index.ts` and `src/index.ts`.
- Config goes on `EngineConfig` in `src/types.ts`.
- Tests in `test/scanners/<name>.test.ts`. Generate samples in the test (see polyglot/archive tests).
- Fail closed with `throw new ScanFailureError(code, message)` when the file cannot be inspected (e.g. corrupt ZIP).
- Update README “What it checks” when shipping a new scanner.
